     A                                  3  2'Lot Number:'
     A            ELOT          20A  B  3 14
     A                                  4  2'Qty On Hand:'
     A            EQTY          15Y 4B  4 15EDTCDE(3)
     A                                  5  2'Received Date (YYYY-MM-DD):'
     A            ERECV         10A  B  5 31
     A                                  6  2'Expiry Date (YYYY-MM-DD, bla-
